      "created_at": "2018-04-12T18:15:01Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-12T18:15:01Z",
      "body": "This is a difficult problem to address. We would need to also remove all of their related records (e.g. plans, answers, roles). If a user removed their account under what circumstances should their plan also be removed? The plan could be public, or co-owned.\r\nWe will need to have a larger discussion of the use cases for this one before we can determine how to size it.",
