      "created_at": "2018-04-13T11:57:08Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-04-13T11:57:08Z",
      "body": "@briri @jollopre according to our GDPR expert, their plans, answers & roles are not personal data and we are not required to remove them. All that is required is to anonymise the account (clear name and email in our case). \r\n\r\nAlso we are not required to provide a button that allows the user to do this - all that is required is a statement somewhere on the website that goes \"If you want to delete your account and all personal data, please contact our@email.address\".",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
